        "51eeef934c946f982135": "Train me.",
        "9668a439676a1ada0ab1": "Greetings, $c.  If you're a friend of Colonel Kurzen then I'll have you cut down where you stand! but if you've come to aid us, then lend an ear...",
        "dccbfbdcb73ed06252e9": "I want to browse your goods."
      },
      "name": "Lieutenant Doren",
